[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2890.23, "timestamp": "00:48:10", "text": "尴尬。我以为你什么都没想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2894.47, "timestamp": "00:48:14", "text": "在这个世界上，这简直令人尴尬。只是在开玩笑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2903.67, "timestamp": "00:48:23", "text": "印度同胞们，也请注意安全。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2907.75, "timestamp": "00:48:27", "text": "我们聊天，我们自己也是印度人。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2910.95, "timestamp": "00:48:30", "text": "安全的。哦是的。我知道你可能不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2914.15, "timestamp": "00:48:34", "text": "有机会看新闻，但我只看了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2916.79, "timestamp": "00:48:36", "text": "今天睡的床。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2919.03, "timestamp": "00:48:39", "text": "不要轻信新闻上的所有报道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2923.54, "timestamp": "00:48:43", "text": "但至少要稍微小心一点。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2926.39, "timestamp": "00:48:46", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2930.15, "timestamp": "00:48:50", "text": "问问你爸爸或妈妈，你知道的，"}]